Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/SCP-firmware/+/584008
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
---
 .../module/scmi_power_domain/src/mod_scmi_power_domain.c        | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_power_domain/src/mod_scmi_power_domain.c b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_power_domain/src/mod_scmi_power_domain.c
index 1773a6792..80183cfef 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_power_domain/src/mod_scmi_power_domain.c
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/module/scmi_power_domain/src/mod_scmi_power_domain.c
@@ -1148,7 +1148,7 @@ static int scmi_pd_init(fwk_id_t module_id, unsigned int element_count,
         return status;
     }
 
-    if (domain_count <= 1) {
+    if (domain_count < 1) {
         return FWK_E_SUPPORT;
     }
 
